# The level 52 Shaman chain: Elemental Mastery (8410, from Sagorne
# Creststrider in Orgrimmar or Beram Skychaser in Thunder Bluff: one of each
# elemental reagent) -> Bath'rah the Windwatcher in Alterac Mountains ->
# Spirit Totem (8412: a Bloodshot Spider Eye and a Thick Black Claw from the
# spiders and bears of the Plaguelands) -> Da Voodoo (8413: three voodoo
# feathers from the troll minibosses of the Sunken Temple).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (givers, objectives,
# droppers); Forever's Shaman class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): Forever no longer
# rewards Da Voodoo's choice of Azurite Fists, Enamored Water Spirit or
# Wildstaff, and names nothing in their place, so the chain pays experience
# and Da Voodoo's money only (Forever's quest data: 3,800 + 5,100 + 6,350 XP and 1g 55s).
# The Sunken Temple's entrance point is the one in
# forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater.guide.
# Mastering the Elements (8411) is the same quest started at Bath'rah
# instead; the two exclude each other, and this guide takes your trainer's.
# Horde only: the Questie data and Forever's quest data list no Alliance version of these quests.
# Dungeon work: the voodoo feathers drop only inside the Sunken Temple, a
# dungeon of the 50s; bring a group.
# Beta capped at 30: not played; it follows the data above.

# Collection: Forever quest 8412 requires eight eyes and eight claws; its
# own text names carrion birds as sources of either, alongside bears/spiders.

step Sagorne Creststrider
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 50 Sagorne Creststrider, the shaman trainer in the Valley of Wisdom, sends you to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.
  accept 8410 npc 13417                       -- Sagorne Creststrider

step Beram Skychaser
  only Tauren,Skyborne
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 50 Beram Skychaser, a shaman trainer in Thunder Bluff, sends you to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.
  accept 8410 npc 3032                        -- Beram Skychaser

step The four elements
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip One each of Elemental Air, Fire, Earth and Water. The Exiles of Arathi Highlands drop them, one element each, about one kill in ten: Thundering (air), Burning (fire), Rumbling (earth) and Cresting (water). Or buy them at the auction house.
  collect 7069 quest 8410.1                   -- Elemental Air: Thundering Exiles
  collect 7068 quest 8410.2                   -- Elemental Fire: Burning Exiles
  collect 7067 quest 8410.3                   -- Elemental Earth: Rumbling Exiles
  collect 7070 quest 8410.4                   -- Elemental Water: Cresting Exiles

step Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Bath'rah camps in the east of Alterac Mountains, north-east of Tarren Mill.
  turnin 8410                                 -- Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  accept 8412

step Spider eye and bear claw
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip In the Western Plaguelands, the Venom Mist Lurkers drop the Bloodshot Spider Eye and the Diseased Black Bears the Thick Black Claw (about one kill in five each). Carrion birds can drop either, so keep what they give you on the way.
  collect 20610 quest 8412.1                  -- Bloodshot Spider Eye
  collect 20611 quest 8412.2                  -- Thick Black Claw

step Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  zone Alterac Mountains
  turnin 8412                                 -- Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  accept 8413

step The Sunken Temple
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip The Sunken Temple (Temple of Atal'Hakkar) lies under the Pool of Tears; the arrow points at its entrance. Gasher or Zul'Lor drop the Amber Voodoo Feather, Hukku or Mijan the Blue, Zolo or Loro the Green: all six are elite trolls inside. Bring a group.
  collect 20606 quest 8413.1 @69.9,53.6       -- Amber Voodoo Feather
  collect 20607 quest 8413.2 @69.9,53.6       -- Blue Voodoo Feather
  collect 20608 quest 8413.3 @69.9,53.6       -- Green Voodoo Feather

step Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  zone Alterac Mountains
  turnin 8413                                 -- Bath'rah the Windwatcher
